{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2017-07", "window": 2, "start_date": 1499472000, "end_date": 1500163199, "month_true_total": 56, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:54:07 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "33555001", "author": {"steamid": "76561198003005055", "personaname": "fataliyev", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198003005055/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 920, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 846, "last_played": 1501524201, "avatar": "36571636a7b86121f89b3537996a294c53e618ff"}, "language": "english", "review": "A quick review for this fun game :\n\nPros.\n\n- Atmosphere! This is the best video game you can feel the 40K world  with all of its elements.\n- Sounds, graphics\n- Story driven gameplay\n\nCons.\n\n- Controls\n- A little bit linear gameplay\n\nIf you are a fan of the 40K world, this game is a must buy. If you have not met with this wonderful setting yet and wondering what it is, give it a shot. It promises great fun.\n\n\"In the darkness all men are equal, save those that embrace it!\"", "timestamp_created": 1500110042, "timestamp_updated": 1500114607, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "33503063", "author": {"steamid": "76561198033111448", "personaname": "aetheriality", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/aetheriality/", "num_games_owned": 897, "num_reviews": 158, "playtime_forever": 345, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 345, "last_played": 1361174400, "avatar": "d50437bcefbeae3ff7729e12bbff87394e000bcc"}, "language": "english", "review": "did i have fun?\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nno", "timestamp_created": 1499951610, "timestamp_updated": 1499951610, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 5, "weighted_vote_score": "0.230629339814186096", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "33499942", "author": {"steamid": "76561198013056859", "personaname": "Blubleeder", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Blubleeder/", "num_games_owned": 1797, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 1805, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1776, "last_played": 1461398710, "avatar": "a5d84cc7e56070b3443a51a68b987d18104260d1"}, "language": "english", "review": "By far one of my most favorite Warhammer 40k game. Endless hours can be lost playing this in campaign and also the multiplayer. \nI would definitely recommend playing the single player first and get used to all the weapons before going online, as most of the people online are veterans. So new players beware unless you want to become cannon fodder.!!!\n\nDefinitely worth the time and money.", "timestamp_created": 1499940863, "timestamp_updated": 1499940863, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "33494738", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079361846", "personaname": "Yeriho", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/malgaja/", "num_games_owned": 261, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 3748, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2030, "last_played": 1737695312, "avatar": "0063e5569ae31a3d593b325f4330e811021ef605"}, "language": "english", "review": "Best warhammer 40k game to this day.", "timestamp_created": 1499917970, "timestamp_updated": 1600295571, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.543761610984802246", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "33488355", "author": {"steamid": "76561198086397160", "personaname": "calvin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/omgitscalvin/", "num_games_owned": 792, "num_reviews": 75, "playtime_forever": 1344, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 992, "last_played": 1774815337, "avatar": "acc859bfc1e81c049d3e5fa16b7168ab7895b421"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun, worth the money on sale for like < $5. But prepare to be frustrated by the stun-heal combo that is very broken. It doesn't make you invulnerable while doing it, so some tiny little orc will inevitably bump into you and kill you mid combo. It's a brutally frustrating mechanic/flaw. Or if you're frustrated by that flaw just die, or exit to title screen and reload with full hp?! :/\n\nAlso some real bad \"sniping behind the box but hitting the top of the box instead of the orc, despite my crosshairs showing I'm right on orc head\" flaws. Which can equally be, \"shooting through the top of the box and getting headshots\"... depending on the box?! But yeah... solid arcade style shoot em up fun.\n\nAlso try to ignore the fact that space marines have giant armor and no helmet, yet headshots never seem to be a problem.", "timestamp_created": 1499891773, "timestamp_updated": 1499894938, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.543726265430450439", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}